    "body": "The shared provenance control and FF8 implementation are in place. FF8 first-start extraction now pulls icon.sp1/icon.TEX privately, renders only the needed local icons, and exposes vanilla plus optional C:/FF8Mod/references/<name> values through the normal dirty/save path. This issue stays actionable because older plugins still have game-specific provenance widgets and non-integrated FF8 fields do not yet have source controls.",
